# packages/dsp-native Phase 1 validation harness's own regenerated summary
# output (ctest re-derives this every run, deterministic) — not checked in.
# Real fixtures (test/fixtures/iowa/*.{wav,aif}, test/fixtures/user-violin/*.wav
# once added), the synthetic fixtures below, and the hand-authored
# RESULTS.md/CLAUDE.md ARE checked in.
packages/dsp-native/test/results/

# NOTE: test/fixtures/synthetic/*.wav (68 files, ~13MB) were gitignored here
# through Phase 7 on the theory that `generate_synthetic_fixtures` regenerates
# them deterministically before every `ctest` run, so there was no need to
# check them in. As of Phase 8, `packages/dsp-ts`'s own conformance suite
# (src/conformance.test.ts) also reads these same WAV files directly via a
# plain `pnpm test` — a JS/Vitest-only path that never invokes the CMake/CTest
# build — so they must now be checked in for that suite to pass on a fresh
# clone without first running `pnpm build:dsp-native && pnpm test:dsp-native`.
# Do not re-add a `packages/dsp-native/test/fixtures/synthetic/` ignore line
# without first checking whether packages/dsp-ts's conformance suite still
# depends on them.

